COMPLETED MISSION REPORT -- RESCUE OF THE FIFTH KAZEKAGE
Rank: S | Joint operation, Sunagakure and Konohagakure

Objective: Recover Lord Gaara, Fifth Kazekage, abducted by the Akatsuki, and
neutralize the responsible operatives.

Forces: Sunagakure committed its own, foremost among them the honored elder
Chiyo of the puppet line and Kankuro of the Sand Siblings, who was gravely
poisoned in an early engagement with the defector Sasori and recovered by Leaf
medical aid. Konohagakure dispatched a pursuit team across the desert in fulfill-
ment of the alliance.

Engagements:
- Chiyo confronted her grandson Sasori, the traitor of the Red Sand, in a duel
  of puppet masters, and prevailed.
- The Leaf team pursued and engaged Deidara to recover the Kazekage's body.

Outcome: Lord Gaara was recovered. Though the One-Tail had been extracted and
the Kazekage fallen, Chiyo gave her own life in a reviving technique to restore
him. The alliance with Konoha was proven in blood. Filed completed, sealed to
the Kazekage Office. The village honors Chiyo's sacrifice.
